# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if having platform-specific dependencies or dependencies
#   having no cross-platform support, pipfile.lock left out may be considered for the edge case.
#   Pipfile.lock is NOT committed by default because it is generated based on Pipfile and not vice versa.
Pipfile.lock

# PEP 582; used by Poetry
